{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_054_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "8db126206a4b1af36307b6e2d06699412c26d6590597522324713e33fb0f085a", "ja": "すっごいわかるよ、琴葉ちゃん！\nお家じゃないんだけど、お家にいるみたいだよね！", "zh": "我特别懂你，琴叶！\n虽然不是家，却有种像在家里的感觉呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
